WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.080
- [Voiceover] Dear BuzzFeed,

00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:08.488
this is how I look with makeup

00:00:08.488 --> 00:00:11.177
and this is how I look without makeup.

00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:16.548
My name is Shalom.

00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:20.327
I grew up in Nigeria where my
family owns a fast food store.

00:00:20.327 --> 00:00:23.349
When I was nine years old
my sister and I fell asleep

00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:26.489
under the table where my
mother fries food we sold.

00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:29.170
We were fast asleep when the hot oil above

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.149
suddenly fell pouring all
over my face and body.

00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:34.970
I remember screaming and crying

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.409
as my family poured water on us,

00:00:37.409 --> 00:00:40.209
and my burning flesh
falling on the ground.

00:00:40.209 --> 00:00:42.209
I spent four months in the hospital.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:45.729
My eyes couldn't open, and my
fingers couldn't straighten.

00:00:45.729 --> 00:00:47.989
When I returned to
school I quickly realized

00:00:47.989 --> 00:00:50.930
life after the incident wasn't
what I thought it would be.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:52.879
Kids would bully and stare at me.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:56.359
Sometimes they even ran away
because my face scared them.

00:00:56.359 --> 00:00:58.019
They called me burned face, two face,

00:00:58.019 --> 00:00:59.760
scarface and so on.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.399
I felt like a living statue
for people to come see.

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:05.170
Then I discovered makeup
tutorials on YouTube.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.590
I watched hours upon hours of videos

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.130
to learn how to do makeup
and soon I was good,

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.810
and my classmates started asking me

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.530
to do their makeup for them.

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.650
But I still didn't feel happy.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.570
Soon I started having suicide thoughts.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.150
Eventually I came across Talia Joy,

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:23.930
a beautiful girl on
YouTube fighting cancer

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.110
and like me she didn't have any hair.

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:27.690
I was amazed by her courage

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.710
to come on camera without a wig.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:33.610
On June 17, 2014 I
posted a photo of myself

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:36.510
without a wig on Instagram
for the first time.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.030
To my surprise people were
positive and encouraging,

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.110
and said my photo inspired
them to also be bold.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:46.150
I felt like a load was
taken off of my shoulders

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.270
because I was finally being honest

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.690
and not giving a crap
what anyone has to say

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.450
about my appearance.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:55.350
This lead to me wanting
to share more with people,

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:57.830
because if Talia could do it, so could I.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.970
And if I can, anyone can.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:02.490
So I decided to start
my own beauty channel

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:05.310
because I wanted to help
other people like me,

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:07.790
not only to learn how to do makeup,

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:10.770
but to learn to love themself
for who they truly are.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.650
Makeup is not the reason why I'm happy,

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.830
it is something I enjoy doing.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:19.170
I'm happy because I've
learned to love myself.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.590
I'm happy that I can be myself

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:23.770
and share my passion with the world.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:27.150
As you can see this is
how I look with makeup

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:29.030
and without makeup,

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.790
and I love both of the sides equally.

